// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2898565280" "Vagabond should have the detonators all rigged to go. Alpha has given us plenty of ghouls. Or, I should say, <i>we</i> took plenty of ghouls with Alpha. They don't have a mind of their own, you have to understand. They're animals following a pack; we just happened to know how to make that pack follow. We've got alpha and four other ghouls, waiting to tear apart the PPD, or to be blown up by us. It's a wonderful thing, using monsters. <color orange>Marty's head jerks to the side with a growl.</color><br><br>We couldn't do this with people. After all, that would make <i>us</i> the monsters and cost us another gun in a fight. If this works, we can turn all the ghouls we encounter into ammo. Cole will soon learn that there's no stopping the Resistance; we'll use every monster he throws at us to bring him down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P688630137" "We've got a problem, {HeroName}. Vagabond can't put the devices on the ghouls just yet. He was almost bitten by the lot of them. It looks like they're hungry, and it's obvious what they're hungry for - <i>flesh</i>. We're not going to be able to move forward unless we feed our army. This is where you come in. We've located a warehouse in Praetoria that houses many of the Clockwork. Today, three PPD officers trained to program them will be running their routine inspections..."
// AcceptString :
"P3993017756" "You need me to bring those officers here for the ghouls' 'dinner'."
// SendOffString :
"P3977074847" "Exactly. We'll feed the ghouls and also disable some of the Clockwork. It shouldn't be too difficult, but you'll have to make sure the Clockwork that they're fixing don't send this report to any of their other robots. We can't have our plans be spoiled, not just yet. Look on the bright side, doing this will discourage any of those bright-eyed, brainwashed youths from joining the PPD. I'll make sure they <i>know</i> what happened to these PPD. Maybe then they'll think twice about signing on board, knowing that one of the risks is being eaten alive.<br><br><color orange>You notice Marty seems to be getting hungry with the mention of food.</color><br><br>It's only fair. It's a danger all of us here face every day, why shouldn't they have to face it too?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1334620706" "Retrieve 'food' for the ghouls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3799814463" "Just remember, these PPD deserve what's coming to them. It's all fair when it comes to this war."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1424615023" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Fodder</color>"

