// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P835486923" "You've gathered the food for the ghouls. Hopefully Vagabond will be able to wire them properly now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2731344097" "Good work, {HeroName}. Vagabond is feeding the ghouls as we speak. That's three less soldiers in the PPD and five more fighters for us in the Resistance. It's an ugly matter, but we live in ugly times. You have to understand, {HeroName}, this was our only option, the only thing we could do to move forward with our plan. In times of war, good men must do horrible things for what is right. That's all that we're doing here: horrible things to make a stand against Cole."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3234296654" "{HeroName}. It's good to see you're still alive. I wasn't sure if you managed to make it through to the Resistance. I imagine you've had to do some things that you aren't proud of.<br><br>We all have to sometimes, you must understand. Tell me, what is happening right now?"
// Answer Text :
"P3762154623" "(Explain the situation to Marchand)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2336524226" "The ghouls... this is worse than I could have imagined. How low are the Resistance looking to stoop in order to fight us? Alright, {HeroName}, I have a plan. I'm sending you a code to use on the alpha ghoul's device.<br><br>When you see the alpha ghoul, you'll want to interact with it and input the code. It will short circuit the devices on the ghouls nearby and kill them. You'll still have to deal with the PPD in that building, but I'll handle that aspect. Just make sure that you don't kill them."
// Answer Text :
"P2004841395" "Sounds like a plan, Marchand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Alpha 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2209018570" "<color orange>The alpha ghoul stares at you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3553377168" "(Enter Marchand's code)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P325021323" "<color orange>You enter the code, causing the collars to short-circuit, killing the ghouls.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1946640642" "Everything is set, {HeroName}. The time has come to unleash our plan. The devices are all hooked up to the ghouls and will react properly when they've reached a certain threshold of pain.<br><br>We've got them packed up and shipped out to one of the main office buildings of the PPD. Just imagine how it'll look in the headlines, the people seeing ghouls <i>out</i> of the tunnels, slaughtering their beloved PPD. Who could they trust after that, knowing that the PPD couldn't fight the ghouls? How could the ghouls have possibly gotten out of the tunnels? Perhaps, most of all, these sheep of Cole will begin to question <i>where</i> the ghouls truly came from."
// AcceptString :
"P677560448" "I'm assuming I'm leading the attack on the office, right?"
// SendOffString :
"P286877708" "Of course. I wouldn't have it any other way. It's crucial that you leave <i>no</i> survivors in that building. Every single member of the PPD in there is going to pay the ultimate price for supporting Cole. We'll be here, waiting eagerly for your return, {HeroName}. Marty will be here as well. Vagabond wanted to send him in, but Marty is far too important to waste on this operation.<br><br><color yellow>Players who originally chose Loyalists but have become Resistance have the option to call up Provost Marchand to tell him about events that are happening. This will begin the optional storyline to work undercover in the Crusaders.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4235281796" "Eliminate all PPD"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P187005288" "This is our time, {HeroName}!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3605896038" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Feast</color>"

