// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P625667332" "Glorious, {HeroName}! That's all I can say. I think we've put the proper fear into the PPD, don't you think? And, we've proven that ghouls <i>can</i> be used to fight for us. These monsters are going to help us turn the tide of the war. The best part is that we won't have to worry about dealing with them when the war is over; we'll just flip a switch, and they'll all explode!<br><br><color orange>Marty looks to Hatchet.</color><br><br>Except for Marty here. Marty is a prime example of a monster brought into civilization. He will be the one we use to find the other ghouls. He's much too valuable to just throw away like those others."

